From 91b28c6d0b0ac7252ecb86e4fa10758ccce2afb8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andy Fiddaman <illumos@fiddaman.net>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 15:19:02 +0000
Subject: Revert "Change int8_t to signed char on Solaris [PR113450,PR123176]"

This reverts commit 0a48b1fe986 for illumos.

Installing the fixed header instead would change the C++ mangling of
int8_t, an ABI break against everything built with earlier compilers.
Keep int8_t as char, matching the illumos header, until illumos changes.
